<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.26 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 6.26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 6.26 percent on Sunday from 4.8 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in 15 reported transactions with a total value of 20.45 million dinars ($28.8 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
